# ---- Series: a chart group's series beyond its first (w.diagram.series), each value a w.diagram.datum ----
# The members' own values are a chart's first series. diagram.chart.series.add makes a series of the chart named
# (`chart`: its code or title; none named: the chart made last), its said values paired with the categories in order
# (more values than categories is refused); change renames, recolours or gives it new values (a category without a
# value takes one); remove removes it with its values. A series has no position or size of its own: its bars and lines
# are drawn from the chart's geometry.
@shp.sers.type core.type of=ui.diagram.sers
@shp.srank.type core.type of=ui.diagram.srank
@shp.schart.type core.type of=ui.diagram.schart
