# ---- Chart points: a category of a chart (a member node of a bar, line, area, pie or doughnut chart) as its value ----
# A point is observed as diagram.sketch.point (its label, value, colour, chart code and title). diagram.chart.point.add
# adds a category with its value at the end of the chart named (else the chart made last); change sets its value,
# label or colour; remove removes it. When a value changes, the chart's other bars or slices lay themselves out again
# (the declared reflow of x, y, width and height, native-interface.sop): the verification reads that as declared.
@shp.cpoint.type core.type of=ui.diagram.cpoint
@shp.cp.m ui.diagram.chartmember node=?c group=?g
@shp.cp.out ui.diagram.cpoint node=?c group=?g
