# ---- Radar: each member a spoke from the centre, its value the distance from it (its share of the axis from the floor
# to the top), the points joined round and filled lightly; rings at each quarter; each label beyond its spoke's end.
# Its radius is the chart's pie radius (90 unless set). A series draws its own shape over the same spokes. ----
@shp.rd.type core.type of=ui.diagram.radar
@shp.rpt.type core.type of=ui.diagram.rpt
@shp.rmax.type core.type of=ui.diagram.rmax
